        "type": "comment",
        "z": "tab-basics-01",
        "name": "Example 3: Asynchronous Non-Deterministic Execution (any interleaving possible!)",
        "info": "Because Node-RED schedules nodes asynchronously on the Node.js event loop, any interleaving of 1, 2, 3 is possible.",
        "x": 320,
        "y": 400,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
